      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:23:31.782235Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "To hide them, click on one of the distributions, e.g., *Poisson*, and then click on the *Hide* button.",
      "source_hash": 8944153237556264322,
      "context_hash": 11899755898289195432,
      "translation": "표를 숨기려면 분포 중 하나(예: *포아송*)를 클릭한 다음 *숨기기* 버튼을 클릭하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Poisson": "포아송",
        "distributions": "분포"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:23:31.782236Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
